["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/nuget", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A reference to a NuGet package. The package locator format is defined in the [NuGet documentation](https://docs.nuget.org) and looks like `package/version`.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Agent is delegating an action to the Agent of the `to` Relationship (which shall be of type invokedBy), during a LifecycleScopeType (e.g. the `to` invokedBy Relationship is being done on behalf of `from`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
